The dense K4 matrix-vector kernel follows MLX 0.32.3 fp_quantized.h,
fp4.h, and fp8.h. Copyright 2025-2026 Apple Inc. MIT License.
The kernel keeps native arithmetic order and replaces FP8 weight loads
with exact EXLR8 K4 decoding. Unused declarations and encoder
constructors are removed. Full license text and source hashes are in
exlr8/metal/dense_k4_decode.metal.
Source: https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx/tree/v0.32.3/mlx/backend/metal/kernels

The attention lookup kernels retain MLX 0.32.3 gemv.h arithmetic and replace
weight loads with exact BF16 block-table lookups. Copyright 2023-2024
Apple Inc. MIT License. Full license text and the source hash are in
exlr8/metal/kv_lookup.metal. The lookup table builder is local code.

The residual-add/RMS kernel follows MLX 0.32.3 rms_norm.metal,
rms_looped. Copyright 2024 Apple Inc. MIT License. It retains the native
reduction and rounds the residual sum to BF16 before normalization.
Full license text is in exlr8/metal/residual_rms.metal.

